{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1308.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"810f9bd361514b591c11d7705a3a39c63d97c662f245df06ffe4138ae615e638","ja":"実は、このみが映画のろけ地で食べた鍋を\nもう一度、食べたいと言っていたのです。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1308.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"022a1dd960374188d3e3588a24c6eeec63794acfe54957ca0d6a2f2674746782","ja":"それなら皆で食べに行こうと思ったのですが、\nすけじゅーるが合う日がなく……。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1308.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"7a6cb4819099cbf1ae3afac179f292267c681d8db67c9d9dd756ba611251623e","ja":"なんだ。それなら、\nここで作っちゃえばいいじゃない。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1308.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"49a38735bea88bd0141c3627ac498dbbc17392b9da9c671af7c063ef497c58d8","ja":"はっ、確かにそれならできそうです。\n……全然気づかなかったぞ。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1308.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"043c12842fbdcd4131b5e75b0cabc30a6b595ce541ea9fd13b4f993930bd8af2","ja":"さすがは桃子。そうと決まれば、\nさっそくお鍋の用意をいたしましょう。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1308.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"84356aea21a17f83935d83a954ec3605d763287b23678b4a60a20906a8a98cf3","ja":"お鍋の具材はだいたい覚えています。ですが、\nお出汁は自信ありません……何が入っていたかな？","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1308.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"cd783922c87fe894639b282e0e633c186a3a1dfa9f437c72aefea95609dcfe7c","ja":"たしか、お味噌が入ってたよね？\r\n他にもなにかあったと思うけど……。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1308.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"3ec069a0d50799a7c526e8550284de812ee2972dab4561b811c564ce2549d37a","ja":"はい。あの風味とまろやかさ……いったい、\nどのような隠し味が入っていたのでしょう……。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1308.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"507c8e91baa4eb58610f770525d208fb72b925308388f282e6580d32ea43d05d","ja":"難問ですが、これもこのみのため。\n必ずやこの謎を解き、お鍋の再現をしてみせましょう！","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
